Also recall that for any complex numbers $z_1$ and $z_2$, $|z_1 z_2| = |z_1| |z_2|$. Therefore, $|\overline{z}^2| = |\overline{z} \cdot \overline{z}| = |\overline{z}| |\overline{z}| = |\overline{z}|^2$.

Since $|\overline{z}| = 5$, we have $|\overline{z}^2| = 5^2 = 25$.

